    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GWD ESTATES are delighted to offer this four bedroom extended property to the Dublin 5 market.\r\n\r\n39 Cromcastle Ave is a highly convenient location close to a wide selection of established amenities including both primary & Secondary schools, shops, sporting and recreational facilities. While Northside Shopping Centre, Artaine Castle Shopping Centre, Omni Park Shopping centre, Gulliver's Retail Park, Beaumont Hospital and DCU are all nearby and within walking distance. There are excellent public transport links serving the area, and the property benefits from easy access to Dublin City Centre. The M1, M50 and Dublin Airport are all close by too.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from an entrance hallway with wooden floors, a sitting room with wooden floors and feature fireplace. The kitchen is extended and modern with bright fitted units with wooden floors. There is a cosy family room to the side and a utility area. The bathroom is downstairs and is a recently fitted four piece suite with ceramic tiles. Upstairs there are 4 bedrooms with wooden floors and wardrobes.\r\nThis fine home boasts Double Glazed Pvc windows and Gas fire central heating. It has been rewired and has a walled west facing rear garden with a  large drive in to the front.\r\n\r\nAll in all this fine home would make a great start for anyone looking to move to the area and viewing is strongly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: 9'11'' x 5'3'' Wooden Floors.\r\n\r\nSitting Room: 14'6'' x 11'2'' Wooden floors with feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nExtended Fitted Kitchen: 14'7'' x 10'5'' Fitted floor and wall presses with wooden floors and door to sitting room.\r\n\r\nUtility Area: 6'4'' x 6'1'' ceramic floor tiles.\r\n\r\nFamily Room: 13'7'' x 8'4'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom: 8'10'' x 6'1'' Bath, walk in shower, toilet and sink with ceramic floor and wall tiles.\r\n\r\nLanding: Carpet. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 11'11'' x 10'11'' Wooden floors with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 14'1'' x 8'1'' Wooden floors.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 8'9'' x 8'8''  Wooden floors with built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 8'9'' x 8'0'' Wooden floors with built in wardrobes."
